# Generated SFT rows carry REAL internal session traces (local paths, usernames,
# session ids). By the sovereignty design they stay LOCAL — never pushed to the
# remote. Regenerate with `node scripts/train/build_dataset.mjs`; the gate
# (scripts/gates/t2.mjs) builds them if missing. personal_terms.json is the only
# committed data file here (generic category markers, no private data).
*.jsonl
manifest.json
